cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software/data, please cite it as below."
title: "TeaWindow: Meijiawu compound climate risk and picking-window assistant"
abstract: >-
  A decision-support prototype for Zhejiang Meijiawu (West Lake Longjing core area)
  that fuses open weather, remote sensing and terrain to identify compound
  frost/heat/drought risk for the early-budding Longjing-43 cultivar, recommend
  picking windows, and generate farmer-facing advisories via an LLM.
authors:
  - name: "TeaWindow Team"
    affiliation: "AI4Climate Global Youth Climate Solutions Challenge (Track 01)"
year: 2026
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Eric2007-sudo/TeaWindow"
url: "https://teawindow.onrender.com"
keywords:
  - climate risk
  - tea
  - Longjing
  - Meijiawu
  - remote sensing
  - machine learning
  - decision support
